DESCRIPTION:HEAD WEST Marketplace\nSunday\, October 4 | Ferry Building\n\n
 Join HEAD WEST Marketplace on Sunday\, October 4th at the iconic SF Ferry 
 Building from 11am–5pm!\n\nFind us on the Ferry Building back plaza\, ri
 ght on the water with epic views — at the base of multiple ferry lines c
 onnecting from around the Bay!\n\nFeaturing:\n\nSHOP SMALL from Local Make
 rs\, Crafters\, Artists\, Designers & Vintage Merchants — ready to share
  their newest finds\, creations and collections with you.\nEAT + DRINK fro
 m all of your local favorite eateries\, bakeries and more in the Ferry Bui
 lding main marketplace + find treats on the back plaza with us!\nEnjoy LIV
 E MUSIC playing all day\nand more!\n\nHEAD WEST is always FREE ENTRY\nALL 
 Are Welcome\nPet + Kid-Friendly\nBring your Friends\, Family & Furbabes!\n
 \nCome for the Marketplace. Stay for the Experience.\n\nHEAD WEST is an Ou
 tdoor Marketplace of Makers\, Crafters\, Artists\, Designers + Vintage Mer
 chants rooted in the Bay Area.\n\nEach marketplace is light rain or shine.
 \nAll outdoor venues are kid + pet friendly\, with ADA Accessible entrance
 s and maintained portable/public restrooms for use.\n\nThe San Francisco F
 erry Building has always been committed to the artisan food + maker commun
 ity\, by fostering the values of the community. Collectively\, this histor
 ic landmark venue holds a vibrant gathering of local farmers\, artisan pro
 ducers\, and independently owned and operated small businesses and the cus
 tomers they serve. It is a community of like-minded people who support the
 ir miss...\n\nFree\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/4/head-
 west-marketplace-at-ferry-building\nSource: DoTheBay
