 et/33409051/7d82e66a-accf-4288-9e58-7409a879c2e4.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001200Z
LOCATION:Workshop\, 1310 Haight St\, San Francisco \, CA\, 94115
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/4/sewing-101-hemming-and-simple-re
 pairs-tickets
END:VEVENT
