DESCRIPTION:Derrick Gee\n\nRadio Hour North America Tour\n\nMonday\, Octob
 er 5\, 2026\n\nDoors: 7:30 PM\n\nAll Ages\n\nSeated performance\n\nView ou
 r FAQ page for more info\, or contact us at [email protected] with any acc
 ommodation requests.\n\nFresh from sold-out tours across Europe and Austra
 lia\, Derrick Gee brings his electric Radio Hour show to North America for
  the first time.\n\nCombining Gee’s sharp musical insights with his gift
  for storytelling\, Radio Hour is a one-of-a-kind\, music-focused variety 
 show that invites audiences into Gee’s on-stage living room for stories\
 , musical discoveries\, and conversation.\n\nFeaturing special guests\, Ra
 dio Hour delivers humorous opinion pieces alongside music from Derrick’s
  personal collection that he will only share behind closed doors.\n\nA cul
 t tastemaker whose wit and wisdom are shaping the way audiences discover a
 nd listen to music\, Sydney-based DJ Derrick Gee found himself propelled i
 nto unlikely online stardom in 2022 when his response to a viral TikTok tr
 end landed him more than 1.3 million followers across multiple social medi
 a platforms.\n\nDrawing on his experience in music\, television\, and crea
 tive direction—as well as shows on NTS Radio and SiriusXM—Gee launched
  his YouTube music series\, Solid Air\, which has welcomed guests includin
 g Lorde\, Jamie xx\, MJ Lenderman\, Fred again..\, PinkPantheress\, and Ma
 x Richter.\n\nGee’s new stage show is a nod to the classic radio hours o
 f the past. Fast\, funny\, and frequently surprising\, Radio Hour reimagin
 es music enterta...\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/5/derr
 ick-gee-s-radio-hour-north-america-tour-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
