 ciation\, this tour explores the breadth of modern manufacturing-from time
 -honored craftsmanship to groundbreaking food science.\n\n4:00 - Meet at W
 oods Yard Park (915 22nd Street at the corner of 22nd and Minnesota)\n\n4:
 05 - Rickshaw Bagworks (904 22nd St.)\n\n5:00 - Wildtype (2525 3rd St.)\n\
 nFree\n\nPresented by San Francisco Public Library\n\nFree\nSan Francisco 
 Public Library\n\nTickets: https://on.sfpl.org/Made-in-SF-26\nDetails: htt
