 ule these screenings based on the number of applications we receive per qu
 arter. Meetings start at 10:30 AM.\n\nCommittee members are: Sean Nash\, C
 arolyn Kualii\, Gina Zetts\, Mai Kong\, Troy Harris\n\nJoin link:\n\nhttp:
