 om 125\, War Memorial Veterans Building\, 401 Van Ness Avenue\, San Franci
 sco\, CA 94102 and streamed online via WebEx.\n\nPursuant to SF Administra
 tive Code\, Sec. 67.7(a)\, the agenda for this meeting will be posted on s
 f.gov at least 72 hours in advance of this scheduled meeting. Please check
  back within 72 hours of this meeting to view the agenda.\n\n-\n\nYou may 
 join the meeting from a desktop computer\, mobile device\, or telephone.\n
 \nYou can learn about WebEx requirements here: https://help.webex.com/en-u
 s/article/n6rk5el/Webex-Meetings-System-Requirements-and-Cross-Platform-In
 formation#Webex-Meetings-Suite-System-Requirements\n\nACCESSIBLE MEETING P
