SUMMARY:Makers Market™ Local Artist Street Fair @ Santana Row
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T130000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-16889234@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Shopping
DESCRIPTION:The Makers Market™ Local Artist Street Fair is returning to 
 Santana Row\, featuring a vibrant lineup of local artisans\, makers\, and 
 small businesses\, just in time for Halloween fun and early holiday shoppi
 ng. Step into the cozy magic of Fall with festive flair\, creative energy\
 , and handcrafted treasures made right here in the Bay Area!\n\nWHEN? Satu
 rday\, October 10 | 11am - 6pm\n\nWHERE? Santana Row in San Jose\, CA\n\n-
  65 local makers\n\n- Handmade jewelry\, pottery\, fragrances\, candles\, 
 bath and body\, crochet\, apparel\, leather goods\, and more!\n\n- Kid- an
 d pet-friendly\n\n- Enjoy live music by local musicians\n\n- This is a sip
  and stroll event! Treat yourself to tasty food and drinks in the surround
 ing restaurants and bars.\n\n- Stop into our brick-and-mortar store adjace
 nt to the fair and shop even more unique\, American-made products.\n\nShar
 e with your shopping buddies and mark your calendars! Can't wait to see yo
 u there!\n\n- - -\n\nAre you a maker looking to sell your products at the 
 Local Artist Street Fair? Register here: https://makersmarket.us/maker-reg
 istration/\n\n- - -\n\nMakers Market is locally founded and independently 
 owned\, with brick-and-mortar stores in Alpharetta\, Napa\, Santana Row\, 
 Lafayette\, and Mill Valley. We aim to bring you products that honor the i
 deals of American craftsmanship and are modern\, handmade\, and sustainabl
