CATEGORIES:The Arts
DESCRIPTION:Are you feeling creatively blocked?\nHas your health altered t
 he way you work in ways you can’t quite pinpoint?\n\nThis workshop is fo
 r you.\n\nYou’ll work with a variety of collage materials\, all provided
 \, alongside guided prompts and reflection that move at a pace built for t
 he room. There will be some story sharing woven throughout\, always option
 al\, and plenty of spaciousness to follow your own creative terrain rather
  than anyone else’s timeline.\n\nYou’ll be free to go as deep as feels
  right\, and no deeper. To take a break if you need one. To skip anything 
 that doesn’t feel like yours to do that day\, or to sit with a blank pag
 e if that’s what’s true for you in the moment. You are the only one wh
 o knows what you actually need\, and we trust that.\n\nCome with whatever 
 is true for you right now. That will be enough.\n\nYou’ll leave with a c
 learer picture of your own creative terrain: a better sense of what the bl
 ock actually is\, real confidence in the strengths and adaptations you’v
 e already built\, and one small idea for how to move forward.\n\nGroup is 
 kept intentionally small so space is very limited. Book today.\n\n$150\, 1
 8+\n\nTickets: https://www.createmefree.com/october-workshop-in-bernal/\nD
 etails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/17/creative-health-cartography
